  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Strictly use the provided JSON color tokens and typography scale.",
    "Implement the UI with React Native standard StyleSheet or NativeWind/Tailwind depending on project setup.",
    "Ensure all interactive elements have data-testid attributes (e.g., data-testid='fab-new-address').",
    "Use Phosphor Icons via expo/vector-icons or phosphor-react-native.",
    "For the address code display, you MUST use 'JetBrains Mono' font, this is crucial for the EFYL brand.",
    "Design for high contrast—outdoor usage in sunlight is a primary use case. Minimum touch targets are 48x48dp.",
    "Implement skeleton loaders for data fetching states instead of ActivityIndicator/spinners.",
    "Use the provided image URLs for onboarding screens and empty states, do not use generic placeholders."
  ]
}